  "name": "Question 8",
  "problem": "Let $c=[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 8 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]$ and $d=[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}].$ Find the vector projection of $c$ onto $d.$\n\n${\\text{proj}}_{d}\\,c=\u27e8$  \n\n{{field-1}},\n\n{{field-2}},\n\n{{field-3}}\n\n$\u27e9$",
